<title>LEBANON: Lebanon issues Jan-Mar debt figures.</title>
<headline>Lebanon issues Jan-Mar debt figures.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's finance ministry issued the following January-March public debt figures (in billions of dollars unless otherwise stated).</p>
<p>	  Net Domestic     Net Domestic   Foreign debt   Total</p>
<p>	   Debt (LBP blns)     Debt</p>
<p>   Jan     13,654	     8.810	  1.851	   10.661</p>
<p>   Feb     14,081	     9.098	  1.863	   10.961</p>
<p>   Mar     14,641	     9.472	  1.883	   11.355</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>   Jan	9,614	     6,041	  1.305	    7.346</p>
<p>   Feb     10,032	     6,317	  1.333	    7.650</p>
<p>   Mar     10,238	     6,465	  1.360	    7.828</p>
<p>($1=1,545.75 Lebanese pounds at end of March 1997)</p>
<p>($1=1,583.5 Lebanese pounds at end of March 1996)</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 745307 345740 602057</p>
